# How Much Longer before It All Works: What Online Searchers Should Know about Wireless Data Communications.

**Authors:** Bell, Steven J.

## Abstract
Profiles the major wireless data communications (WDC) systems, provides an overview of how they work, and compares their communication features. Topics addressed include the market for wireless data; applications for WDC; wireless online searching; cellular data communication; packet radio; digital cellular; criteria for evaluating WDC systems; and personal digital assistants. (Contains eight references.) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ476381

